{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":203048,\"title\":\"A Cara do Pai\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"On the verge of adolescence, Duda fills the days of her father—the recently separated Théo—with the joys of childhood and the anxieties of her age.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kl4QHkprQBKAMZ5XKdsz3dmi7xN.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zThwl7GMyQNhEq2b5ka8fQw4Lfl.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2016,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"status\":\"Canceled\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":2,\"totalEpisodes\":15,\"createdBy\":[\"Leandro Hassum\",\"Paulo Cursino\"],\"networks\":[\"TV Globo\",\"Globoplay\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"BR\",\"name\":\"Brazil\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2017-12-31\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1086110,\"name\":\"Leandro Hassum\",\"character\":\"Théo\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ulXMwJqQMZwSpKyx3We1LSJUVXX.jpg\"},{\"id\":1475116,\"name\":\"Mel Maia\",\"character\":\"Duda\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cvbWK16gNUCCclHneWPpA63zeLZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":1352680,\"name\":\"Alessandra Maestrini\",\"character\":\"Sílvia\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/16iGTMLxSMegqlOhJqEOOuQTyBb.jpg\"},{\"id\":2135131,\"name\":\"Thiago Rodrigues\",\"character\":\"Ricardo\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e4p6IQgfuWhJaFl5VUUjf0cSjuw.jpg\"},{\"id\":1306967,\"name\":\"Walter Breda\",\"character\":\"Aldair\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xFZ8C6o5UPLKimTbLf2CQAcWA1a.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"m0egsFCDTIo\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"uouCo9PqxVo\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"LObOvN9QjRg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Season 2\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8ofFsfc0Lbkvb43mg8Z36J6t2u0.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2017-10-08\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 1\",\"overview\":\"Théo's apartment is falling apart. Things get worse when he has to host Duda's friends for a sleepover.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u7ZG33JLIcwO7rk8xJY6MxnG0bi.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-10-08\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"Duda wants a pet dog. Théo tries offering a cockatiel, a fish... but without success. It is on the street that Duda finds her pet.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bfxQYl2DPAmU1DADVbMr3pMFPYx.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-10-15\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"The administration of Duda's school says she is being aggressive. The solution is for her parents to maintain a friendlier relationship.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eanwPsSeYpapfhIbVDyPmkJ8ZjE.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-10-22\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"Are Théo's days of being in a good mood numbered? His insecurity grows after watching a YouTuber's show.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yH9moiZTcM8PH3O74R32ETB2eSv.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-10-29\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"Duda gets excited after playing a futsal match and asks to be enrolled in a training academy. Inspired, her friends want the same thing.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o7KvREwtWYKd5W1mzelr0VajJUQ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-11-05\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"For Gui to date Duda, he has to win Théo's approval—complete with an interview. Then, an unexpected friendship blossoms...\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ndueiiTiBGcDfOf2valYYnUWbKR.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-11-19\",\"runtime\":27},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"Iolanda has barely arrived at the apartment, and Théo already wants his mother-in-law to leave. And it seems her relationship with Silvia is far from good...\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cr4DCLJJPh1oZOHW1IJuiGEqM9y.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-11-26\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"The building's new residents are constantly up to no good; their mother doesn't even care, and Duda does everything she can to prove who is responsible.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wAny7u67qO8ThaNXZO2kSiNGRRV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-03\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 9\",\"overview\":\"Théo applies to teach at Duda's school. He proposes a talent show and needs to discover his daughter's best talent.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1euPm3vt6iKdIh0oGFVSuamPnAD.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-10\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Episode 10\",\"overview\":\"Joana asks Alice to sleep at Théo's apartment. She takes the opportunity to gather her friends, and other guests begin to arrive.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r4uSp68Rq5F16Y4Tx22YpKtxHMm.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-17\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Episode 11\",\"overview\":\"A literally cheap pest control treatment in Théo's apartment leaves everyone suffering from allergic reactions. They decide to seek shelter at Joana's place.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4YfwlcGUuqRoxidFeMIafg0eUr.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-24\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Episode 12\",\"overview\":\"Would a girlfriend make Théo calmer? Duda wants to find out. And suddenly, he finds himself facing the discovery of potential fatherhood.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uEskUBstbjh04RizAu2OUu4WxBd.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-31\",\"runtime\":25}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2016-12-18\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}